00:17:10,780 --> 00:17:11,380
then you might as well

586
00:17:11,380 --> 00:17:12,700
suck on your mom's teats forever.

587
00:17:15,140 --> 00:17:15,980
Emotions aren't just

588
00:17:15,980 --> 00:17:16,720
