590
00:17:18,460 --> 00:17:20,240
You really don't get it, do you?

591
00:17:21,640 --> 00:17:22,580
But go on.

592
00:17:22,740 --> 00:17:23,580
Keep up the good work

593
00:17:23,580 --> 00:17:24,460
