598
00:17:31,540 --> 00:17:33,380
Yeah, anime harem hero,

599
00:17:33,520 --> 00:17:34,100
I wish.

600
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:36,840
You know what?

601
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:38,460
I wish I could give everyone

602
00:17:38,460 --> 00:17:39,220
