603
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:41,340
but life isn't some romantic anime

604
00:17:41,340 --> 00:17:43,180
and I can't fix what's wrong in life

605
00:17:43,180 --> 00:17:44,540
stumbling around being oblivious

606
00:17:44,540 --> 00:17:45,600
and nice all the time.

607
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:46,920
Believe it or not,

608
00:17:46,980 --> 00:17:48,640
this isn't very easy for me either.

609
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:50,400
I know that I'm not the hero.

610
00:17:50,540 --> 00:17:51,260
I will most likely

611
00:17:51,260 --> 00:17:52,300
