612
00:17:52,580 --> 00:17:52,920
Surprise,

613
00:17:53,120 --> 00:17:54,580
I'm just as scared as you are.

614
00:17:54,580 --> 00:17:55,920
So you take it out on Rika?

615
00:17:56,040 --> 00:17:56,760
Real classy.

616
00:17:56,760 --> 00:17:58,300
I never said I was classy.

617
00:17:58,700 --> 00:17:59,960
I never said I was anything.

618
00:18:00,940 --> 00:18:03,000
The club is a place I've never had.

619
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:04,060
It's like a miracle.

620
00:18:04,600 --> 00:18:05,980
A home where freaks like us

621
00:18:05,980 --> 00:18:07,040
can just be who we are

622
00:18:07,040 --> 00:18:07,940
without feeling like

623
00:18:07,940 --> 00:18:08,880
we had to hold back.

624
00:18:09,320 --> 00:18:10,520
I don't want to screw that up,

625
00:18:10,580 --> 00:18:11,440
but that is exactly

626
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:12,280
what I was doing

627
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:13,200
and you know it.

628
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:16,580
This whole thing is meaningless

629
00:18:16,580 --> 00:18:17,240
if it ends up

630
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:18,280
making you hold back.

631
00:18:18,740 --> 00:18:19,680
You've pretended to be

632
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:20,560
the oblivious guy

633
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:21,400
since day one

634
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,200
and when you couldn't

635
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:22,800
fake it anymore,

636
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:23,520
you ran away.

637
00:18:23,620 --> 00:18:24,120
What's the point

638
00:18:24,120 --> 00:18:24,820
of loving somewhere

639
00:18:24,820 --> 00:18:25,820
so much that you feel

640
00:18:25,820 --> 00:18:26,560
like you have to leave

641
00:18:26,560 --> 00:18:27,760
just so you can protect it?

642
00:18:28,080 --> 00:18:28,920
We never asked you

643
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:29,820
to sacrifice yourself

644
00:18:29,820 --> 00:18:30,280
at the altar

645
00:18:30,280 --> 00:18:30,980
