646
00:18:30,980 --> 00:18:31,920
so don't be stupid!

647
00:18:32,220 --> 00:18:33,360
You think you can talk?

648
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:34,140
Fuck you!

649
00:18:34,860 --> 00:18:35,400
Who's playing

650
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:36,700
the sacrifice card again?

651
00:18:37,020 --> 00:18:37,820
Oh, you pretend

652
00:18:37,820 --> 00:18:39,200
to be Little Miss Class Cloud.

653
00:18:39,600 --> 00:18:39,900
Meanwhile,

654
00:18:40,060 --> 00:18:40,900
you never stop working

655
00:18:40,900 --> 00:18:41,540
behind the scenes

656
00:18:41,540 --> 00:18:42,340
to make sure everything

657
00:18:42,340 --> 00:18:42,900
is perfect.

658
00:18:43,020 --> 00:18:43,760
You're too damn good

659
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:44,620
to all of us!

660
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:45,700
And here you are

661
00:18:45,700 --> 00:18:47,220
taking the thankless role again.

662
00:18:47,520 --> 00:18:48,400
You're just as guilty

663
00:18:48,400 --> 00:18:49,800
of holding back as I am.

664
00:18:50,360 --> 00:18:51,080
Both of us

665
00:18:51,080 --> 00:18:52,200
