666
00:18:52,340 --> 00:18:53,060
What the hell else

667
00:18:53,060 --> 00:18:53,740
do you want?

668
00:18:55,540 --> 00:18:56,380
Come on.

669
00:18:56,740 --> 00:18:57,480
What do you think

670
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,240
Rika wants?

671
00:18:58,900 --> 00:18:59,720
What did we start

672
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:01,020
