673
00:19:02,100 --> 00:19:03,020
For friends!

674
00:19:03,200 --> 00:19:04,240
I want friends!

675
00:19:04,360 --> 00:19:05,760
All I want are friends!

676
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:06,400
Friends!

677
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:32,520
Rika, sorry, Kotika.

678
00:19:32,520 --> 00:19:35,080
She lied about controlling

679
00:19:35,080 --> 00:19:35,600
