681
00:19:36,740 --> 00:19:37,340
Then what are

682
00:19:37,340 --> 00:19:38,080
the ears for?

683
00:19:38,520 --> 00:19:39,400
They're just a toy

684
00:19:39,400 --> 00:19:40,400
