686
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:42,360
Really?

687
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:43,260
That's kind of cool.

688
00:19:43,260 --> 00:19:49,720
You sure are a tough fighter,

689
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:50,060
Rika.

690
00:19:51,800 --> 00:19:52,800
Same to you.

691
00:19:54,560 --> 00:19:55,660
The truth is,

692
00:19:55,740 --> 00:19:56,980
Rika can't stand anymore.

693
00:19:57,120 --> 00:19:57,860
She's exhausted.

694
00:19:58,740 --> 00:19:59,860
Yeah, me too.

695
00:19:59,860 --> 00:20:03,400
Hey, Kotika.

696
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:05,200
What's up?

697
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:08,120
If you can't fix things

698
00:20:08,120 --> 00:20:08,740
on your own,

699
00:20:09,460 --> 00:20:09,940
please,

700
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:11,620
