701
00:20:12,340 --> 00:20:12,840
Remember,

702
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:14,840
Rika is literally a genius.

703
00:20:15,680 --> 00:20:17,360
She eats impossible problems

704
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:18,000
