712
00:20:31,100 --> 00:20:32,560
What did you say, my ass?

713
00:20:32,600 --> 00:20:33,380
Don't be stupid.

714
00:20:35,880 --> 00:20:36,620
Yeah, well,

715
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:38,260
don't be stupid yourself, stupid.

716
00:20:40,140 --> 00:20:42,000
I'm already your friend, right?

717
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:43,740
We all already

718
00:20:43,740 --> 00:20:44,600
are your friends.

719
00:20:44,600 --> 00:20:50,220
It was then I realized.

720
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:51,460
Ten years ago,

721
00:20:51,520 --> 00:20:52,760
