722
00:20:53,740 --> 00:20:54,640
You're wrong.

723
00:20:55,580 --> 00:20:56,900
I'll prove I'm not weak.

724
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:00,980
Except this time,

725
00:21:01,080 --> 00:21:01,980
