728
00:21:07,180 --> 00:21:08,340
It's just weak,

729
00:21:08,940 --> 00:21:09,380
pathetic,

730
00:21:10,040 --> 00:21:11,200
probably fractured

731
00:21:11,200 --> 00:21:12,360
Kotika Hasegawa.

732
00:21:13,540 --> 00:21:14,100
Rika,

733
00:21:14,600 --> 00:21:15,700
