734
00:21:16,040 --> 00:21:16,780
Sure thing.

735
00:21:19,500 --> 00:21:20,500
Well, this is one

736
00:21:20,500 --> 00:21:21,360
for the Neighbors Club

737
00:21:21,360 --> 00:21:22,060
history books.

738
00:21:22,820 --> 00:21:23,760
We made friends.

739
00:21:35,720 --> 00:21:36,400
Hey, Senna.

740
00:21:40,400 --> 00:21:41,600
I wanted to...

741
00:21:41,600 --> 00:21:51,440
I'm leaving on a journey.

742
00:21:51,780 --> 00:21:53,060
Please don't come looking for me.

743
00:21:55,560 --> 00:21:56,040
What?

744
00:22:00,040 --> 00:22:03,680
Of course.

745
00:22:04,080 --> 00:22:05,400
I don't know what I was thinking.

746
00:22:05,400 --> 00:22:06,260
I don't know what I was thinking.

747
00:22:06,260 --> 00:22:07,680
Looks like our tragically flawed

748
00:22:07,680 --> 00:22:09,420
